#section{Yet Another Mark Down language}::

An indentation-based markup language that compiles to an element IR (HTML
first). One sigil (#code{#}), one form per role (calls), and documents that
are programs in a pluggable host — headings, lists, links, tables and math
are all library functions, not syntax.


